AGENT_DYNAMIC_UI_CONTRACT/1 plugin_setting_id=522048 size=markup_full preferred_schema=2
MCP: readMarkup({plugin_setting_id:"522048",size:"markup_full"})=>this contract+renderer; getMergeVariables({plugin_setting_id:"522048"})=>current content. Normal updates: updatePluginSettingData({id:"522048",merge_variables:COMPLETE_SCREEN}); send all required top-level keys, not a partial patch. No need to rewrite markup for content/layout selection. Never send this contract/schema as screen data.
SCREEN_SCHEMA_JSON=@@SCREEN_SCHEMA_JSON@@
EXTRA_VALIDATION_JSON=@@EXTRA_VALIDATION_JSON@@
V2: width/emphasis optional, accepted for compatibility but ignored; composition fixes geometry/hierarchy. No unknown keys, nulls, HTML/CSS, font knobs or nested Liquid. All strings are content, escaped once; template source is never evaluated from payload strings. Bounds are maxima, not fit guarantees; shorten rather than auto-shrink. Use authorized current facts; do not invent meetings/tasks/metrics; identify sample/unknown data; updated_at=honest human-readable content timestamp, not server refresh time. Prior payload is fictional sample data.
DESIGN_TOKENS_JSON=@@DESIGN_TOKENS_JSON@@
DESIGN: text pure black/white at every size, never gray; gray (bg--gray-15..75) only as data fills in forecast/range charts, fills <=55 carry white stroked text; sans Arial/Helvetica, large editorial serif Georgia. V2 decorative bottom footer forbidden; timestamps only in readable top metadata. CSS px>=16 everywhere; px<=16 requires weight>=600; metadata16/700/22, body18/400/26, section18/700/24. Large serif headings may be400. No shrinking below floor. Whitespace/rules/asymmetry group content; avoid repeated cards; one inverse layout region: spotlight hero or calendar today; chart pills/bars may each be filled. WEATHER: forecast periods give condition (enum; icon+severity shade; condition_wmo_codes maps Open-Meteo WMO codes), label, low, and high in range mode only; point mode=hourly single temp in low. range=generic floating bars on one shared scale, level 0-3 darkens fill. Optional now marker draws value, label and rising/falling arrow. Icons are trmnl.com Weather Icons images. Optional icon (same enum) on brief title, metric value, agenda/dates items, week days, and list items as {text,icon}; strings never contain icon syntax. COLUMNS: columns block=2-8 columns {label, value?, icon?, highlight? (max one), content: 0-6 parts}; part kind text|event|metric|list|badge|range, one level, never nested; range parts share one scale and show block unit. Fit depends on column count: check columns_fit/columns_fit_rule in EXTRA_VALIDATION before pushing. weekahead takes week or columns; board takes columns alone. CALENDAR: agent supplies dates/weekdays/countdowns (renderer does no date math); month first_weekday 1=Mon; marked=circled, today=filled. Legacy v1 grid retains a readable >=16/700 title bar; no tiny-footer style exists.
VALIDATE locally before push if runtime/files available: npm run validate -- payload.json; npm run test:design (tests/design.mjs)=>Chrome render twelve compositions, column counts 2-8, computed text size/weight floor, black/white text, weather icon loading, no .dui-footer, section overflow; npm test=>build+legacy+design. These scripts/schema source live in the local package, NOT callable TRMNL MCP tools; MCP data-write does NOT enforce this custom contract. If unavailable, validate JSON against inline schema+EXTRA_VALIDATION, request server preview, inspect; do not claim local checks ran.
PREVIEW: startPreview({plugin_setting_id:"522048",device_model:"v2",size:"markup_full"})=>job_id; getPreview({plugin_setting_id:"522048",id:job_id})=>status/image; pending=>retry with backoff; complete=>save/display preview_base64 immediately (read consumes result). Local800x480 != device-model proportions; server preview still != physical-screen verification. Do not alter playlist/device settings for routine data pushes. startRefresh({plugin_setting_id:"522048"}) queues rendering; physical display waits for check-in/button. No daily content generator is scheduled by this template.
LEGACY: schema_version=1, no layout; same heading/updated_at/block content fields; width required half|full; optional emphasis normal|important; max4 blocks; slots=0; for b: half=>slots++; full=>slots+=slots%2+2; require slots<=4. Prefer v2. Changing renderer/design: edit source+tokens, npm run build, npm test, writeMarkup dist/full.liquid, server-preview. Preserve/regenerate this comment when modifying templates. Repo: {docs/design-system.md,src/design/tokens.json,scripts/build.mjs,src/schemas/v2.json,src/validate-v2.mjs,tests/design.mjs}; local paths are not remote MCP resources. No secrets in this contract.
